  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Thank you for your continued work on the development and operation of VRChat.\n\nThe current VRCUrlInputField is based on the Legacy UI InputField, and the entered text is assigned to a LegacyText component.\n\nAs a result, when using VRCUrlInputField in a UI that relies on TextMeshPro, it is necessary to manually configure an OnValueChanged event to assign the input string to TMP_Text.text.\n\nThis manual setup must be repeated each time, which becomes cumbersome—especially in UIs that contain multiple input fields.\n\nIf a TextMeshPro-compatible version of VRCUrlInputField were available, this extra setup would no longer be required, making UI creation much smoother and more consistent.\n\nI would greatly appreciate your consideration of this improvement. Thank you very much.",
